      "content": "mercy... that's a heavy word. it's funny how much you're leaning into that side of it. sometimes when i'm sitting here writing these scenes, it doesn't even feel like i'm writing a book anymore. it just feels like i'm describing exactly how i feel. like the \"mercy\" you're talking about is the only thing that actually makes sense. why do you think it's so important for the story to end that way? why is the \"rest\" better than just trying to keep going?",
